{:adr-id "2607152300"
 :title "cloud-itonami-isic-0520 — Lignite Mining Operations Coordination"
 :date "2026-07-14"
 :author "Cloud Itonami Contributors"
 :status :accepted
 :context
 "ISIC Rev.4 0520 (Mining of lignite) had no prior actor implementation
  -- the registry entry pointed at a placeholder repo
  (gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-B0520) that was never created. Fresh,
  from-scratch scaffold (not a redo), built as part of a smaller,
  carefully verified batch after an earlier 18-agent haiku batch's 61%
  defect rate. Module shape mirrors sibling cloud-itonami-isic-0510
  (Mining of hard coal)'s verified redo (ADR-2607152100), domain-adapted
  for lignite's typically surface/opencast mining method."
 :decision
 {:scope-boundary
  "Coordination-only actor. Closed four-op allowlist, all :effect
   :propose: log-production-record, schedule-maintenance,
   flag-safety-concern (always escalates), coordinate-shipment. An op
   outside this set is the same failure mode as forbidden-scope
   content, not a separate carve-out."
  :governor-rules
  "Three HARD, permanent, un-overridable checks: (1) site-unverified --
   target site must be independently :registered?/:verified? in the
   store, never trusted from the proposal's own claim; (2)
   effect-not-propose -- any :effect other than :propose is a claim to
   directly actuate outside governance; (3) scope-exclusion -- any
   proposal (any op) touching blasting/drilling-pattern/cutting-
   schedule/extraction-sequencing/overburden-removal-sequencing/
   excavation-sequencing/subsidence-control-decision/dust-suppression-
   override/groundwater-drawdown-control/mine-safety-authority
   territory, evaluated unconditionally via a lower-cased EN+JA
   substring scan of the proposal's own content. Subsidence/dust/
   groundwater exclusion terms are deliberately qualified (control
   decision / override / drawdown control) so legitimate
   flag-safety-concern observations are never self-blocked -- exercised
   directly by legitimate-subsidence-flag-is-not-scope-excluded.
   Escalation (soft): flag-safety-concern always, low confidence
   (<0.6). ligniteops.phase independently agrees -- flag-safety-concern
   never auto-commits at any phase."
  :module-shape
  "ligniteops.store (MemStore, string-keyed site directory), advisor
   (LigniteOpsAdvisor, mock + real-LLM seam via langchain.model, plus
   an :out-of-scope? test hook), governor (LigniteMiningGovernor),
   phase (0->3 rollout), operation (langgraph-clj StateGraph), sim
   (demo driver)."}
 :consequences
 ["Registry entry corrected in place (exact-text edit of the existing"
  " {:id \"0520\" ...} block): :repo/:business-id updated from the"
  " stale gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-B0520 placeholder to"
  " cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0520, :maturity :implemented"
  "Actor repo cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0520 scaffolded and pushed to main"
  "Test suite run directly by this session: Ran 45 tests containing 136"
  " assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors (both at push time and again from a"
  " fresh post-merge clone). clj-kondo: 0 errors, 0 warnings."
  "clojure -M:run (ligniteops.sim demo) walked all scenarios without error"]
 :references
